  <p>We all have old PDFs locked from years ago. Maybe it's an invoice from 2018 or a contract you signed. If you created the PDF or had the password originally, you can unlock it now.</p>

  <h3>Scenario 2: PDFs from Work Colleagues</h3>
  <p>Your colleague sends a protected PDF they created. You can't print or annotate it. Enter their password (they should share it internally) and unlock it.</p>

  <h3>Scenario 3: PDFs from Government/Financial Institutions</h3>
